{"2865350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ZOMBIECAM", "steam_appid": 2865350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OUT NOW</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies. Guns. Bodycam. ZOMBIECAM blends realism and immersion in a well paced first person shooter arena experience. Fight against hordes of zombies in round-based  arena environments, achieve in-level weapon unlocks and use explosives and the environment to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEVELS: Map environments look and feel authentic with realistic lighting and effects. Some photorealistic assets are also in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBAT: Hordes of zombies get bigger and more diverse throughout each round. Apex zombies are harder to kill. Use the layout of the arena to your advantage and use the right weapon for each horde situation you are in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WEAPONS: Weapons feel powerful and do the job of reducing the horde. Unlock more weapons are the initial rounds go by. Flamethrower and explosive crossbow are the ultimate zombie killing tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUD: ZOMBIECAM has a realistic display with no HUD other then the bodycam-style border. Temporary blood on screen when taking damage. The overall display of the game leans towards realism along with lifelike audio effects as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NIGHTVISION MODE: A separate nightvision-only mode that can be played at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHAMBER OF PAIN: An open level with  scattered bouncepads. Adds an extra dimension to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press and Inquiries: <a href=\"mailto:contact@zombiecamgame.com\">contact@zombiecamgame.com</a></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OUT NOW</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies. Guns. Bodycam. ZOMBIECAM blends realism and immersion in a well paced first person shooter arena experience. Fight against hordes of zombies in round-based  arena environments, achieve in-level weapon unlocks and use explosives and the environment to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEVELS: Map environments look and feel authentic with realistic lighting and effects. Some photorealistic assets are also in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBAT: Hordes of zombies get bigger and more diverse throughout each round. Apex zombies are harder to kill. Use the layout of the arena to your advantage and use the right weapon for each horde situation you are in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WEAPONS: Weapons feel powerful and do the job of reducing the horde. Unlock more weapons are the initial rounds go by. Flamethrower and explosive crossbow are the ultimate zombie killing tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUD: ZOMBIECAM has a realistic display with no HUD other then the bodycam-style border. Temporary blood on screen when taking damage. The overall display of the game leans towards realism along with lifelike audio effects as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NIGHTVISION MODE: A separate nightvision-only mode that can be played at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHAMBER OF PAIN: An open level with  scattered bouncepads. Adds an extra dimension to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"